@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@apiKey = dev-loca
@code = article1

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Create a link with an alias
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/links
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com/article",
  "customAlias": "{{code}}"
}

### Resolve the short code (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{code}}

### Read click statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/links/{{code}}/stats
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
